    {
      "id": "0300bd2faa2c8516b2afaae063460ea5135a62e5073534d67db71717615fcf01",
      "text": "Tools & Environment",
      "hash": "cf9194302814cf2bb2ae04f0e1023fec3d18acdc5258a0e00c18bb7df366cf00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c261761db94be78c74dc09cb1f7d88e0cc3bf893f9e96521c626533e550f0db6",
      "text": "Filesystem",
      "hash": "8230c68a6158c8ba8c1b7d5b8e0557be9564e129e15806f60dc2205a9ca5bfe7"
    },
    {
      "id": "829dda3e7285816fc5ee8439857b2db44dfff9bab3bd245904780ccde4bc89c0",
      "text": "A tree of files and directories the agent reads from, writes to, and executes within — the default environment for a coding agent.",
      "hash": "37020af223f0586d2a5a3ab33f55c4a0dccf939268a99f20a7dbc7c23a1ec726"
    },
    {
      "id": "cdea85d2adb0a6dfc7dab5296b38714bb1e1c2f20d8e7c1294f0971e9315bb4c",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "10bf707220bda70e9fe8e7520e10cc5e56f18cd40d86578d419070329e053e6c",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "c605af2ab22ec81b77fdf418594bd9b54a6ec791711d5f8bce0e26973bc5bbf2",
      "text": "A tree of files and directories the",
      "hash": "4d748e391922888f550fd9b237a1589416b5537cbf87ca181ca446d6b0a0c082"
    },
    {
      "id": "227193c5941c930e2c846ee4149022309a8a2940ac5809a88f2cd770315fbf85",
      "text": "reads from, writes to, and executes within — the default kind of",
      "hash": "f3f45f6ae9b259f039713a89ca4e99df779ac37f64846755f02f729629d5f0ef"
    },
    {
      "id": "691b9b15503961bb30126e7fbb6aa86a996bc5e4c5128f3718a98781cad068c3",
      "text": "for a coding agent.",
      "hash": "39f41820e560ddf80dcb34a527846cab455f2a763ac9c55cecadb480d3461324"
    },
    {
      "id": "ef6b2248b76bc2b804a6290fedc8673fa7766ac15b3365fde387bd0625a6e45c",
      "text": ", source code, build scripts, and",
      "hash": "0b7359adcb3873c11c555d961606c46b0b9c318e7638cf53998e242f3c6ebfc8"
    },
    {
      "id": "9c4ba654dd13d60b80953a64eae5e96be54c8ef010abecb3011ad4d09a5a85af",
      "text": "configs all live in a filesystem. When a",
      "hash": "be152154d725bcf89f568b3daadff1020498a0f681e8562a0f91b43f3175421b"
    },
    {
      "id": "4537c4ced8f2e1dbde9e49011b85c63fd057b95852de01f564e0a28d6be13724",
      "text": "\"starts in your project,\" it's pointing the agent at a filesystem.",
      "hash": "4350682b6079162aa8eafdfba6bf329ec85326604ba7a6cff1a9ef008b6992c4"
    },
    {
      "id": "829fdcbb7b230bf96e98fca43861a92163b186b48ddcaef0161066439c787e62",
      "text": "The agent touches it only through",
      "hash": "39bc7f456f7ddaff8e3e4a9e298f00ee9a1d97ae3e576e9208925c04feb1a817"
    },
    {
      "id": "f3889fb224c5ef3e98310c1fea687a4380ad7cfe4d6bf7a6ff183ade0632d0a0",
      "text": "tool calls",
      "hash": "b102cdc6032df9ca67169a6d620fba86a9b0344b8dab71565a5b230deadb5e68"
    },
    {
      "id": "dd2f02c536d41ab0f6dbaa5464ddcaf99926c3b34579e0de7933fb7a0625d6f4",
      "text": "— reading a file, writing one, running a shell command. Nothing on disk is in the",
      "hash": "4a2666cd7b617dda3175078ab7573b90a710d841aba4b6e7dd108b9d7f0d1012"
    },
    {
      "id": "97df8d6c6e6f413e2f5ef4aef41f7f7358ec61ff454fe40ae557056a5a1e4f81",
      "text": "context window",
      "hash": "6764434518d37f01df452fe2af0af3f314f8c27a72519001ea14189c5ee42476"
    },
    {
      "id": "b9704910c8cbc12c10453c46a2fc2f5098aa88fcf17a22cf4f32b92822dd64f8",
      "text": "until a tool call loads it, which is what lets the agent work in a repository far larger than the window: the filesystem holds everything, the context holds only what the current task has read. Some harnesses do load the current directory's filenames into the context window by default — not the contents, just the tree — which act as",
      "hash": "08a33d96d559981b1d4abd7e8733286d262239c22f9b1a299ed5a704b5d91bf5"
    },
    {
      "id": "61c1a89631043fc73f48bc98cfa04e55c96d9106c3dfaa84114490aa8a021d87",
      "text": "context pointers",
      "hash": "82528bbf7c9c348f2db59980c707a48c7c85c4ea3d7f7f63f107a209445930c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "59da8b5cdaa91360d92568d516064484304e245d96a6c4d826e39ab226f92c10",
      "text": ": the agent sees what exists and reads the files it needs.",
      "hash": "51b0978f7abb2cff42bdacc230dec450f80d992e75954373e609c1e57cfba405"
    },
    {
      "id": "55e2dce753385e8852b608d13d50245b4257b996fc373d4bbd534dea20fe268f",
      "text": "And it's shared with you. The files the agent edits are the same ones you open in your editor and diff in git — the filesystem is the common workspace where you review what the agent did.",
      "hash": "b10ba8ae8c5cb9fceb491ab0eab1e57f0b05c00b7eb66217f1289de77e78476b"
    },
    {
      "id": "d2d17dd0ff3de4d4c7b6677d554c7c688ebe4825aaa37445cad2cde87c0825ea",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "e8284c8ac2675566224610a55b8b79084efeaf62bdc64acb48ea8ec351e38575",
      "text": "\"Why isn't it picking up my AGENTS.md?\"",
      "hash": "4b50682c7343e1a3c85f53c2f07269e66f931058e58d42f0e0fd60557eb688c8"
    },
    {
      "id": "8e7ce65d6eb3fa5857748157837eb4c935fbf3c86f155f3d0f86e5c004c1ab6b",
      "text": "\"It's running against a different filesystem — the",
      "hash": "e76fe580552f067c2a2f835b1c756f1de95bab16ffa2919e73f9d4d4fb018ec4"
    },
    {
      "id": "80e67a55dfe222c4d747bf5c7fe79ba38bc0b7bf641045436c3fda1f7deaaf8e",
      "text": "mounted the parent dir, not the project root. Repoint the harness.\"",
      "hash": "7832c1536b063420ba84564294d33431403c69b8a2b662c06b582282ce9e89d5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5d2ae625a208b3d3c39f5b221ae6740aa404fe3a6011b7eb072405b113ac583",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "1c0a9e906d03d6ea9744413085ff6705b15f72d71ef1bc12deba49be03e86186",
      "text": "Environment",
      "hash": "9e471951a1b4106e54be128a21112b02914fe98cc79b2c92b49ee80c5464487c"
    },
    {
      "id": "108fad4c945c935379a4d2a2ddefb3d97923cc678ddef7e62cbbc74fb6ebe003",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "42ffc05321c3371af635ba4436a316b90e07018c1b8aff1b9358d45bc081cffc",
      "text": "Tool",
      "hash": "2e53bdcd0740867b597599e733c04a994f55fb17c89a61595183a001742e5705"
    },
    {
